dzhuUXlrNVNjZ2ozVWtTMjFqLTBUVktrZXVuR0lFeEtZLVZRZEJmS1hkUWc1WVF3X0tLYlptN1NWQTJSVXBKVkpWb1d2LWtVY2ZtOVV3UUZDVHJkMFVKUTh1Mm1iYlpITkw?oc=5","date":"2026-11-01","zh":"荷美爾食品（NYSE：HRL）會維持股息成長動能嗎？"},{"title":"Hormel Foods serves up winning ‘homegating’ treats","src":"Snack Food & Wholesale Bakery","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxNb0NmUDBCaEF5ZFA0NUJnMmVZRG4yRzFjT2UwNGtVSlM2X01BQ1dsWlpwc21UYk01ZGV4Ym9Tb0FkTjdDUDdCY1BweHFYd2JwWWd2ZVpMZVYtYW96LXI1Ul9EQmVBXzRybHBtMzdtS1pWQ01vVGR2Q0Y0a1NMLWZxNllVRjgxSkZNeHFxZndFMVVuNk42UDN5bTlNWQ?oc=5","date":"2026-10-31","zh":"荷美爾食品 (Hormel Foods) 推出獲獎「回家」款待"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":3},{"name":"股票回購/股利","count":3},{"name":"分析師評等","count":3},{"name":"併購","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2025-12-05","period":"2025-10-26","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/48465/000004846525000059/hrl-20251026.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Hormel Foods Corporation, a Delaware corporation, was founded by George A. Hormel in 1891 in Austin, Minnesota, as Geo. A. Hormel & Company. The Company originated as a processor of meat and food products and continues in this line of business today. The Company has expanded its product portfolio through organic growth and acquisitions to become a global branded food company with more than $12 billion in annual revenue. The Company is built on a foundation of innovation and integrity and a commitment to delivering high-quality, trusted food products across a diverse portfolio of brands and product solutions including Planters , SPAM , Jennie-O , Skippy , Applegate , Wholly , Hormel Black Label , Fontanini , Bacon1 , Hormel pepperoni, and more than 30 other beloved brands. The Company is a member of the S&P 500 Index and the S&P 500 Dividend Aristocrats.","zh":"Hormel Foods Corporation 是一家特拉華州公司，由 George A. Hormel 於 1891 年在明尼蘇達州奧斯汀創立，當時名為 Geo。 A.荷美爾公司。該公司最初是一家肉類和食品加工商，至今仍在繼續從事這項業務。該公司透過有機成長和收購擴大了產品組合，成為年收入超過 120 億美元的全球品牌食品公司。該公司建立在創新和誠信的基礎上，致力於透過多元化的品牌組合和產品解決方案提供高品質、值得信賴的食品產品，包括 Planters、SPAM、Jennie-O、Skippy、Applegate、Wholly、Hormel Black Label、Fontanini、Bacon1、Hormelpepperoni 以及 30 多個其他深受喜愛的品牌。該公司是 S&P 500 指數和 S&P 500 Dividend Aristocrats 的成員公司。"},{"en":"When used in this report, the terms \"we,\" \"our,\" \"us,\" and the \"Company\" mean Hormel Foods Corporation and its subsidiaries, collectively, unless the context otherwise requires or indicates.","zh":"本報告中所使用的術語「我們」、「我們的」和「本公司」統指荷美爾食品公司及其子公司，除非上下文另有要求或指明。"},{"en":"The Retail segment consists primarily of the processing, marketing, and sale of food products sold predominantly in retail channels, including grocery stores, mass merchandisers, club stores, natural food chains, drug, dollar and discount chains, and e-commerce providers in the United States (U.S.). This segment also includes the results from the Company's MegaMex Foods, LLC (MegaMex Foods) joint venture.","zh":"零售部門主要包括加工、行銷和銷售主要在零售通路銷售的食品，包括美國的雜貨店、大型超市、俱樂部商店、天然食品連鎖店、藥品、美元和折扣連鎖店以及電子商務提供者。該部門還包括該公司合資企業 MegaMex Foods, LLC (MegaMex Foods) 的表現。"}],"markets":[{"en":"The Retail segment consists primarily of the processing, marketing, and sale of food products sold predominantly in retail channels, including grocery stores, mass merchandisers, club stores, natural food chains, drug, dollar and discount chains, and e-commerce providers in the United States (U.S.). This segment also includes the results from the Company's MegaMex Foods, LLC (MegaMex Foods) joint venture.","zh":"零售部門主要包括加工、行銷和銷售主要在零售通路銷售的食品，包括美國的雜貨店、大型超市、俱樂部商店、天然食品連鎖店、藥品、美元和折扣連鎖店以及電子商務提供者。該部門還包括該公司合資企業 MegaMex Foods, LLC (MegaMex Foods) 的表現。"},{"en":"The Foodservice segment consists primarily of the processing, marketing, and sale of food products to distributors and operators across a wide range of providers of food away from home, including restaurants, hospitality, healthcare, K-12, college and universities, and convenience stores in the U.S.","zh":"餐飲服務部門主要包括加工、行銷和向各種戶外食品供應商的經銷商和營運商銷售食品，包括美國的餐廳、飯店、醫療保健、K-12、學院和大學以及便利商店。"}],"customers":[{"en":"The Company has a global presence within several major international markets, including Australia, Brazil, Canada, China, England, Indonesia, Japan, Mexico, the Philippines, Singapore, and South Korea. Distribution of export sales to customers is primarily done by third party carriers, while the China and Brazil operations also rely on company-owned and operated delivery systems. The Company has licensed other companies to manufacture various products internationally on a royalty basis. The Company also has minority interests in food companies in the Philippines (The Purefoods-Hormel Company, Inc., 40 percent holding) and Indonesia (PT Garudafood Putra Putri Jaya Tbk (Garudafood), approximately 30 percent holding).","zh":"該公司在多個主要國際市場擁有全球業務，包括澳洲、巴西、加拿大、中國、英國、印尼、日本、墨西哥、菲律賓、新加坡和韓國。向客戶的出口銷售分配主要由第三方承運商完成，而中國和巴西的業務也依賴公司擁有和經營的交付系統。該公司已授權其他公司以特許權使用費為基礎在國際上生產各種產品。該公司還在菲律賓（The Purefoods-Hormel Company, Inc.，持股 40%）和印尼（PT Garudafood Putra Putri Jaya Tbk (Garudafood)，持股約 30%）的食品公司中擁有少數股權。"}],"competition":[{"en":"The production and sale of meat and food products in the U.S. and internationally is highly competitive. The Company primarily competes with manufacturers of pork and turkey products as well as national and regional producers of other meat and protein sources, such as beef, chicken, fish, nuts, and plant-based proteins.","zh":"美國和國際上肉類和食品的生產和銷售具有高度競爭力。該公司主要與豬肉和火雞產品製造商以及其他肉類和蛋白質來源（例如牛肉、雞肉、魚、堅果和植物蛋白）的國家和地區生產商競爭。"},{"en":"All operating segments compete on the basis of price, product quality and attributes, brand identification, breadth of product line, and customer service. Through effective marketing, a dedicated network of direct and indirect sales personnel, and robust quality assurance programs, the Company's strategy is to provide high quality products that possess strong brand recognition supported by reliable customer service, to support a higher value proposition for customers and consumers. To grow and maintain its competitive position, the Company focuses on meeting customer and consumer preferences, delivering product innovation, and maintaining long-term and lasting relationships with industry partners.","zh":"所有營運部門都在價格、產品品質和屬性、品牌識別、產品線廣度和客戶服務等方面競爭。透過有效的營銷、專門的直接和間接銷售人員網路以及強大的品質保證計劃，公司的策略是提供具有強大品牌知名度的高品質產品，並輔以可靠的客戶服務，為客戶和消費者提供更高的價值主張。為了發展和維持競爭地位，公司專注於滿足客戶和消費者的偏好、提供產品創新以及與行業合作夥伴保持長期持久的關係。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-10-26","items":[{"name":"Retail","val":7455218000,"zh":"零售部門"},{"name":"Foodservice","val":3941795000,"zh":"餐飲服務部門"},{"name":"International","val":709146000,"zh":"國際"}],"total":12106160000},"prod":{"end":"2025-10-26","items":[{"name":"Perishable Meat","val":8823022000,"zh":"易腐爛的肉類"},{"name":"Shelf Stable","val":3283138000,"zh":"貨架穩定"}],"total":12106160000},"geo":{"end":"2025-10-26","items":[{"name":"US","val":11437051000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Non Us","val":669109000,"zh":"非我們"}],"total":12106160000}},"peers":["MKC","GPC","CPB","DOV","SJM"]}}